"description": "CVC Capital Partners Plc is an investment holding company, which engages in the provision of management and adviser services to investment funds and credit vehicles. It operates through the following segments: Private Equity, Secondaries, Credit, Infrastructure, and Central. The Private Equity segment consists of four private equity strategies: Europe, Americas, Asia, Strategic Opportunities, and Catalyst. The Secondaries segment focuses on secondary markets globally. The Credit segment invests in companies through dedicated vehicles and investment solutions for both performing credit and private credit. The Infrastructure segment refers to mid-market infrastructure investments. The Central segment reflects all non-investment of people costs and all non-people costs of the business, including all costs related to business operations. The company was founded by Rolly van Rappard in 1993 and is headquartered in St. Helier, the United Kingdom.",
